   "evidence": "TwoForm.lean:94-104: `lemma apply_zero_left ...` has no attribute; `@[simp] lemma apply_zero_right ...` directly below. No simp lemma unfolds the `CoeFun` (line 75-77) to `toContMDiffSection`, and `bilinFormAt_apply` (line 85-87) is simp in the direction toward `form x v w`, so `form x 0 w` cannot be closed by simp without the tag. The add/sub/neg pairs are consistently untagged, matching Mathlib's `LinearMap.BilinForm.add_left`/`zero_left` (mathlib/Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/BilinearForm/Basic.lean:65-86), so only the zero pair is inconsistent.",
